cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data in your research, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Reproducibility Package: Computational Methods for RS OBB Detection"
abstract: >
  Complete reproducibility package for a PRISMA-compliant systematic review
  of 112 peer-reviewed works (2014-2025) on data augmentation and labeling
  for oriented object detection in remote sensing imagery. Includes
  meta-analysis code, rotation bug audit tools, BOI calculator, and
  supplementary data tables S1-S7.
